     "side": "t",
     "title": "Edges, not samples",
     "text": "A beep is 267 bursts. Their edges hold everything the bench needs: carrier, pitch and length."
    },
    {
     "from": 13.48,
     "to": 20.52,
     "anchor": [
      "p",
      100000.0,
      -0.9
     ],
     "at": [
      720,
      730
     ],
     "side": "t",
     "style": "ok",
     "title": "One tick: 26.7 ns",
     "text": "4 cycles of the 150 MHz system clock. Every path through the PIO program takes 4 cycles, so the counter keeps time."
    },
    {
     "from": 23.12,
     "to": 31.27,
     "anchor": [
      "p",
      183333.3333333333,
      -0.9
     ],
     "at": [
      720,
      730
