     "style": "warn",
     "title": "BEEP LOST",
     "text": "A missing number, a ring overrun or a stopped capture ends the run."
    }
   ],
   "say": [
    {
     "at": 0.8,
     "text": "The panel receives each beep with its own times from the I O M C U's clock. Now it only has to count."
    },
    {
     "at": 9.18,
     "text": "Beeps closer than 700 milliseconds belong to one group. Silence of 700 milliseconds ends it: this group counts 3."
    },
    {
     "at": 18.45,
     "text": "One group is not enough. The bench acts only when three groups in a row came in order: 1, 2, 3. Then it moves the throttle, and the setting is chosen."
    },
    {
     "at": 30.46,
     "text": "If a beep is ever missing from the numbered records, the run stops. It does not guess."
    }
   ]
